**Prerequisite:** Death, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Wisdom, Intelligence, or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When a creature dies within 30 feet, you may use your Reaction to choose one:

prevent its corpse from being animated for 24 hours;

preserve its soul from ordinary destruction for 24 hours;

allow it to speak one final sentence;

end one ordinary possession affecting its corpse;

grant one ally who can hear the final breath Temporary HP equal to your Proficiency Bonus.

This Insight is favored by orthodox Death cultivators.

