**Prerequisite:** Stars, CL 12+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Wisdom, Intelligence, or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you successfully apply Stable Stellar Mark to a creature, you may learn one of the following:

its current direction from you;

whether it is on the same plane;

whether it is under a teleportation, invisibility, or concealment effect;

whether it has damaged you or an ally during the current scene;

whether it is protected by a Star Anchor, Formation, or spatial ward.

You can use this Insight a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus between Full Cultivation Sessions.

