**Prerequisite:** Puppetry sphere, Two-Body Control, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Intelligence, Dexterity, or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you maintain more than one active puppet vessel, choose one vessel at the start of each turn as your leading hand.

The leading hand gains one of the following benefits until the start of your next turn:

+10 feet Speed;

+2 AC;

Advantage on the next Strength or Dexterity save it makes;

the next Puppet Strike made through it deals extra damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus.

