**Prerequisite:** Magma, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Constitution, Strength, or Intelligence score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When one of your Magma talents ends, choose one affected 10-foot area.

Transform it into one:

• obsidian barrier;

• jagged difficult terrain;

• short staircase;

• defensive ridge;

• Half Cover position;

• simple obsidian platform;

• sealed volcanic cap over a pit, vent, or fissure.

The structure lasts 1 hour unless destroyed.

