**Prerequisite:** Music sphere, Disruptive Harmony or Silence-Breaking Note, CL 10+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Charisma, Wisdom, or Dexterity score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

When you succeed on a Music Check to suppress, disrupt, or identify a Sound, Music, War, Formation, or Spirit effect, gain one benefit:

regain 1 CP;

regain Martial Focus;

grant one ally within 30 feet Temporary HP equal to your Proficiency Bonus;

impose Disadvantage on the next Concentration saving throw made by the disrupted creature before the start of your next turn.

Use Resonance Breaker once per scene.

