**Prerequisite:** Samsara-Wheel Cultivator, reincarnation inheritance, or genuine former-life awakening; CL8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

At the end of a Full Cultivation Session, choose one Former-Life Memory:

- one skill proficiency;
- one tool proficiency;
- one language or script;
- one weapon-group proficiency;
- one narrow historical field; or
- one non-Secret Sphere talent from a Sphere you already know and for which you meet every prerequisite.

The Memory remains until you replace it during another Full Cultivation Session.

A talent selected this way uses your Qi and Qi Cultivation statistics when legal and cannot be inherited, permanent, identity-exclusive, or dependent on anatomy or an Asset you do not possess.

Once per scene, reroll one failed roll that directly uses the active Former-Life Memory. You must use the new result.

