**Prerequisite:** Magma, CL 8+

**Ability Increase (Level Selection):** Increase your Constitution, Strength, or Intelligence score by 1, to the maximum allowed by your current Realm.

Once per turn when damaging an object, structure, vehicle, Barrier, or Formation Anchor through a Magma talent, choose one:

• add your Proficiency Bonus to one damage roll;

• deal double damage to an unattended ordinary object or mundane structure;

• ignore ordinary hardness;

• reveal a visible crack, weak point, pressure seam, or load-bearing failure.

This does not automatically destroy artifacts, permanent Formations, Domains, or Realm-defining structures.

